# Swamp of Sorrows (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Swamp of Sorrows
# for a Horde buyer, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Seven ship as buys from
# Stonard's Horde vendors (Masat T'andr's two Leatherworking patterns;
# Gharash, Rartar and Banalash stock); five ship as narrow mob drops with
# Swamp-only droppers. Masat's remaining 9 recipes are generic multi-zone
# world drops (Elwynn rule) and do not ship. Everything else
# Swamp-touching (~130 items, argued per case in the inventory) is a
# generic world drop with no in-zone sole dropper. Quest records carry no
# reward data, so no quest-reward recipe ships (logged in
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Tailoring, Engineering and
# Leatherworking have no Swamp Horde source beyond the two patterns, so
# that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/swamp-of-sorrows-horde-recipes
title Swamp of Sorrows (Horde) - Recipes
levels 30-38
zone Swamp of Sorrows
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords swamp of sorrows, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Stonard - Leatherworking patterns

  zone map 1435

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 11874 -- Masat T'andr (26.46, 31.47)
  buy 15726 "Pattern: Green Dragonscale Breastplate" npc 11874
  buy 228309 "Pattern: Living Green Dragonscale Breastplate" npc 11874
  goto 26.46,31.47
  note Masat T'andr is the sole vendor anywhere in the data for both patterns. His remaining 9 recipes are generic multi-zone world drops and do not ship here.
  note Stock class unconfirmed - check in game.

step Fallow Sanctuary - Giant Scrambled Eggs (Cooking)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 60.93,24.28
  goto 61.82,21.85
  goto 62.39,20.9
  goto 62.5,23.31
  goto 63.98,22.8
  goto 65.23,22.8
  kill 1106 optional
  collect 250186 "Giant Scrambled Eggs" optional
  note Lost One Cook (level 37) is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes the recipe.

