step Stonard - smithing, demonslaying and the trade goods

  zone map 1435

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  vendor 8176 -- Gharash (45.46, 51.41)
  buy 7995 "Plans: Mithril Scale Bracers" npc 8176
  goto 45.46,51.41
  note Gharash (Horde) is the in-zone source; the same plans ride Alliance vendor Harggan elsewhere. Stock class unconfirmed - check in game.

step Stonard - demonslaying draughts (Alchemy)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 8177 -- Rartar (45.39, 56.87)
  buy 9300 "Recipe: Elixir of Demonslaying" npc 8177
  goto 45.39,56.87
  note Rartar (Horde) is the in-zone source; the same recipe rides Alliance vendor Nina Lightbrew in the Blasted Lands. Stock class unconfirmed - check in game.

step Stonard - enchants and campfire fare

  zone map 1435

  when skill Enchanting 1

  vendor 989 -- Banalash (44.77, 56.63)
  buy 11223 "Formula: Enchant Bracer - Deflection" npc 989
  goto 44.77,56.63
  note Banalash (Horde) is the in-zone source; the same formula rides Alliance vendor Mythrin'dir in Teldrassil. Stock class unconfirmed - check in game.

step Stonard - campfire fare (Cooking)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 989 -- Banalash (44.77, 56.63)
  buy 12232 "Recipe: Carrion Surprise" npc 989
  buy 16111 "Recipe: Spiced Chili Crab" npc 989
  goto 44.77,56.63
  note Banalash (Horde) is the in-zone source for both; the same recipes ride Horde vendors elsewhere (Ogg'marr, Kireena, Uthok) and Alliance vendors in Westfall. Stock class unconfirmed - check in game.

step Professions with no Swamp Horde source

  zone map 1435

  note Tailoring, Engineering and Leatherworking have no recipe source physically in Swamp of Sorrows for a Horde player beyond the two Stonard patterns above - stated, not padded. First Aid and Fishing are covered only by the Muckdweller drop above (First Aid) and nowhere in-zone (Fishing).
